  {
    "source": "Monsters also react to noise, and may disturb nearby monsters when becoming aware, alerting them to your presence. Medium and heavy melee weapons will make noise on attacks, so a light weapon might be more ideal for a stealthy combat approach. Some sounds are louder than others, for example firing a gun or kicking down a door is likely to attract some attention.",
    "target": "怪物也会对噪音作出反应；它们察觉到动静时可能惊扰附近的怪物，暴露你的位置。中型与重型近战武器攻击时会发出声响，因此潜行作战时轻型武器可能更合适。不同声音的响度也不同，例如开枪或踢开一扇门很可能引来注意。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:240"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "Monsters unaware of your presence have a blue background on their map icon. This is their default mode. While in this state they may roam the map, but they will not actively search for you or purposefully attack you. If you attack an unaware opponent in melee, the attack does +50% extra damage, and has a very high chance to hit.",
    "target": "尚未察觉你的怪物，其地图图标背景为蓝色，这是它们的默认状态。它们可能会在地图上游荡，但不会主动搜寻或刻意攻击你。如果你在近战中攻击未察觉你的敌人，伤害会额外提高50%，并且命中几率很高。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/manual.txt:226"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
